          "_name": "services2",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"services2\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <!---->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle 2\" name=\"showSubtitle2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Align Buttons:\" name=\"alignBtn\" condition=\"showButtons\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>Left</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">Center</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <!---->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Media on Left/Right\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Media Size\" name=\"mediaSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"80\" step=\"5\" value=\"30\">\n        <!---->\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background2.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#efefef\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <!---->\n    <!--Overlay-->\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <!--Container-->\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-figure\" mbr-style=\"{'width': mediaSize + '%'}\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/vender-con-tranquilidad-2-520x830.png\" alt=\"Vender con tranquilidad\" title=\"Vender con tranquilidad\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"align-left aside-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-title pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><p><b>Descarga mi guía pa</b><b>ra vendedores de seguros:</b></p></h2>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-text\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text text1 pt-2 mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".text1\">Mi guía práctica te ayudará a mejorar tus ventas y tener un ingreso seguro de mes a mes, tanto para que tengas estabilidad financiera sin perder la estabilidad de tu mente, con mi proceso:<br><b>VENDER CON TRANQUILIDAD.\n                        </b></p>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text text2 pt-4 mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle2\" data-app-selector=\".text2, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            $690 <span class=\"cost\">$890</span>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!--Btn-->\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-class=\"{'align-left' : alignBtn == 1, 'align-center' : alignBtn == 2, 'align-right' : alignBtn == 3}\"><a href=\"assets/files/VENDER-CONTRANQUILIDADbyCamilaVelasquez..pdf\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-cursor-click mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Descargar PDF</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
